title: A Congress of Five Currents
subtitle: Every faction wants unity. Every faction also wants the chair.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_faction_congress_timer <= 0 and razem_in_left_club = 1 and razem_split = 0 and (internal_dissent >= 25 or faction_vetoes > 0 or party_unity <= 60 or primary_active = 1)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_faction_congress_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/faction-congress.webp

= A Congress of Five Currents

The television shot will show one Left. Backstage, the SLD barons count
delegates, Wiosna wants a progressive mandate, Razem demands written guarantees
and the parliamentary newcomers refuse to be treated as scenery.

- @common_calendar
- @new_generation
- @machine_compromise

@common_calendar
title: Buy agreement on a common calendar
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Unity now, without settling who ultimately controls the project.
choose-if: resources >= 1 and faction_vetoes <= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The organisers lack one resource, or multiple caucuses have already declared vetoes.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.party_unity += 6;
Q.barons_dissent -= 3;
Q.spring_dissent -= 3;
Q.labor_dissent -= 3;
Q.progressives_dissent -= 3;
Q.razem_dissent -= 3;
Q.public_trust -= 1;
Q.turnout_readiness += 2;
Q.primary_cross_faction_pact = 1;
Q.primary_rules_written = 1;
Q.news_headline = "Five caucuses sign one precarious calendar";
!}

The leaders agree on candidate selection, programme deadlines and a rule against
surprise press conferences. Journalists correctly describe the deal as a truce,
but a truce is more useful than five simultaneous offensives.

- #poland_card_finish

@new_generation
title: Put the women-led new generation on the main stage
subtitle: Progressive credibility rises; the old apparatus starts counting enemies.
choose-if: progressives_strength + spring_strength >= 34 and progressives_dissent < 60
unavailable-subtitle: The younger currents lack the weight or cohesion to take the stage.
on-arrival: progressives_strength += 2; progressive_credibility += 4; feminist_trust += 3; progressives_dissent -= 4; spring_dissent -= 2; barons_dissent += 5; party_unity -= 1; media_capacity += 1; young_support += 3; women_support += 3; urban_progressive_support += 2; women_led_mandate = 1; primary_new_generation = 1; news_headline = "A new generation takes the front row"

You give younger progressive organisers real authority over equality policy and
candidate preparation. The photographs finally resemble the movement's voters.
The barons notice that this was a transfer of power, not a branding exercise.

- #poland_card_finish

@machine_compromise
title: Let the old apparatus run the congress
subtitle: Cheap, orderly and conservative. Razem and Wiosna will remember it.
on-arrival: resources += 1; barons_strength += 2; barons_dissent -= 5; local_network += 2; razem_dissent += 5; spring_dissent += 3; progressive_credibility -= 2; party_unity += 1; rural_support += 2; pensioner_support += 2; young_support -= 1; primary_machine_slate = 1; news_headline = "The old machine produces a flawless congress"

The hall is full, the votes occur on time and every regional chair knows their
instructions. The alliance looks professional. It also looks rather more like
the SLD that some partners believed they had replaced.

- #poland_card_finish
